        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in an unending forest, trees as far as the imagination can reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did you get here? Where even are you?<br><br>At this point you are really only left with one option, chop trees and hone your senses as you venture through the mysterious forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However strutting through the lush grass you can't help but feel a forbidding presence. Perhaps just the wind...<br><br><strong>Game Mechanics:</strong>Chop trees with your trusty axe and gather wood. The wood can then be used to upgrade certain stats such as your power, so it will be less cumbersome to chop more trees.<br><br>Explore the world as there are secrets scattered throughout the forest. Find new equipment to make your journey easier.<br><br>Try and delve into the mysteries of the forest or simply find joy in gathering wood.</p>",
